From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tsuji Riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:21:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] gpio: add Celestial CNC1800L GPIO controller

The vendor GPIO block has 41 lines in two ports with an inverted
direction register (1 = input) and level interrupts (mask, polarity and
status per port, all on SoC IRQ 6), which gpio-mmio cannot describe.
Add a small driver with an interrupt chip that emulates edge interrupts
by waiting for the opposite level after each edge. Register layout of
the vendor cnc18xx_gpio.c.
---
